WEBVTT

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:58.910
On Dragon Ball Z, Zarbon underwent a shocking transformation.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.300
After this horrific new appearance,

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.500
Zarbon gained an equally terrifying level of power.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.420
And in this monstrous form,

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:12.220
he quickly took control of the battle with Vegeta,

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:14.980
unleashing a relentless barrage of attacks

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.340
that brought the high and mighty Saiyan Prince crashing down.

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:23.000
I'm through, Joy!

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:26.210
It's time to end this little game right now!

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.600
With Vegeta utterly powerless to defend himself,

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.560
Sarbonne was determined to finish him off, once and for all.

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:46.820
If he was still breathing after that impact, he won't be for long.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:53.360
Meanwhile, Krillin and Dende completed their dangerous journey to the home of the eldest Namek.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.060
Welcome.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:59.370
Will he be able to aid them in their quest for the Dragon Balls?

00:02:59.510 --> 00:02:59.870
Find-

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:01.040
TODAY!

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:43.390
