00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:16.500
Right. To Namix, the Dragon Balls symbolize wisdom and power, but this Frieza sees him only as a tool

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:22.980
to serve his greed. Forgive me for being blunt, Mr. Guru, but that's exactly why we came here,

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:29.920
to ask for your Dragon Ball so we could hide it from Frieza. I won't let him get his hands on it.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.470
And that's a promise.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:35.660
I see. So then you two are collecting the Dragon Balls?

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:40.080
Yes, but my motives are for good and not evil like Frieza's.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.620
Krillin lost several of his friends.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.340
He wants to wish them back.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.560
They died fighting these evil men on Earth,

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:50.060
and if they return, they may be able to help us drive them from our planet.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.940
How is it you know of the Dragon Balls?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.250
We used to have another set on Earth.

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:56.510
Impossible.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.980
A long time ago, when the terrible storm hit the devastating...

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.920
There was one Namek who managed to escape.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.290
He left Namek in a spaceship.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.250
It took him halfway across the galaxy to my planet.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.390
He was only a child when he got there,

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.630
but he grew up to become the Guardian of Earth.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.950
He's the one who created the Dragon Balls.

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.690
Yes, I remember now.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:26.970
The child of Katas.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:29.940
Call me. Pleased to hear you mean...

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:38.200
journey safely he was a gifted child the dragon family he had the power to create the dragon balls

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:44.470
kami was killed during our battle with the saiyans and the one responsible was vegeta the same one

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:53.190
who's here on namek oh this saiyan must be horrible indeed what an awful power one who

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:59.720
could defeat a namek like kami must have been a super saiyan a super saiyan what's that you mean

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:04.840
Please, come closer, and we will solve this puzzle.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.580
Um, uh...

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.620
Now, clear your mind so I may feel your best.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:14.940
Okay.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:45.730
Emek at war with himself, Torn, too.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:18.470
guardian of the earth kami first had to purge even the smallest trace of evil from his heart

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:27.260
thus he split into two and piccolo was born in doing so his powers were also split equally

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.980
between these two halves if they had

