00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.540
Now, I have seen your mind.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:42.380
Your heart is pure and your intentions are true.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:45.910
Your bravery and your loyalty to your friends are beyond question.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:49.820
