00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:13.640
You do my people a great service, young man.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:14.900
Any time.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:19.090
Indeed, you are brave, and there is much strength in you,

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:22.990
