00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.170
Well, in that case,

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:51.410
would you mind trying this trick on a friend of mine?

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.930
He's really a great kid,

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:56.230
and I tell you, if anyone I know has hidden powers, it's him.

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.980
Bring him to me, and if I can, I will un-

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:09.120
his potential great i'll be right back but what should i do with the dragon ball i entrusted it

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:20.030
to you its fate along with the fate of this entire planet now rests in your hands all right dinde you

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:25.610
wait here i'll come back with gohan as soon as i can please be careful krillin

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:10.120
