00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.160
Well, I didn't check his pulse, if that's what you mean.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:46.020
But I'm telling you, it's highly unlikely that he survived. A chance in a million, maybe.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:50.130
